{"id": "EUVD-2026-102961", "enisaUuid": "a452fe85-1f2e-3ccd-a746-c5685ca90deb", "description": "ClickVisual through 1.1.2 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the /api/v2/reports handlers that allows authenticated low-privileged users to access ClickHouse instances they were not granted. Attackers can iterate the instance-id parameter in ReportSourceDatabases, ReportSourceTables, ReportTableColumns and WhereCheckRun to enumerate schemas and infer row counts of restricted tables.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T13:25:08", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/clickvisual-report-module-missing-authz-cross-instance-idor", "https://github.com/clickvisual/clickvisual/blob/v1.1.2/api/internal/api/apiv2/report/report.go#L282-L343", "https://github.com/clickvisual/clickvisual/blob/v1.1.2/api/internal/service/report/metadata.go#L136-L152", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/clickvisual-through-1.1.2-missing-authorization-in-apiv2-report-module"], "aliases": ["GHSA-92qp-c535-v34g", "CVE-2026-111670"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "eae8074d-000e-38dc-b21a-8635e073aad5", "product": {"name": "clickvisual", "vendor": {"name": "clickvisual"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.1.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "46fc7ada-9351-3ac7-8ac3-620f552422b7", "vendor": {"name": "clickvisual"}}], "isExploited": false}